= Staal Public Works

Staal, having survived Goodryke's schemes for the meantime, is now set to receive the political benefits of getting the Commonwealth people back to work. Staal was essentially seen as a dead man to the Commonwealth public, lacking confidence of the people and DuFour's inner circle—but's that's now set to change.

The trade unions are ecstatic, and projected decreases in unemployment—combined with the global economic recovery, is expected to garner much public support for the Staal cabinet and a deradicalization of the party landscape, taking away the fuel the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span> and <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> thrives on.

For Staal, the plan serves a dual purpose: to revitalize the Commonwealth’s economy in preparation for rearmament and a return to power on the world stage, and to pressure the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span> into cooperating with his cabinet before their electoral prospects decline as their base returns to work.

- @schleicher_2

@schleicher_2
title: Land in sight!
on-arrival: staal_economy_time = rubicon_time + 24; staal_approval += 3; papen_economy_time = 0; staal_victory += 1; commons_royalist -= 3; commons_collectivist -= 5; disfavored_collectivist -= 5; disfavored_royalist -= 3; pro_republic += 8; dufour_staal_r += 2; staal_strength += 2; papen_strength -= 1; dufour_gallax_r -= 3; gold_left += 5; ddp_left += 3; ddp_cohesion += 3; lvp_left += 5; staal_marcher_influence += 1; staal_marcher_influence += 1 if wtb_adopted; staal_marcher_influence += 1 if staal_marcher_r >= 4; staal_marcher_r += 1; staal_marcher_r += 1 if wtb_adopted; staal_marcher_support += 4; staal_marcher_support += 2 if wtb_adopted

With Staal delivering on a widely popular promise and the <span style="color: #000000;">rep</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">ubl</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">ican</span> parties beginning to soften their stance toward the government, positive reports about him from across the political spectrum have begun to reach DuFour.

This early victory for the Staal cabinet has dealt a significant blow to Goodryke’s schemes. The President is now more inclined to view Staal favorably, reducing the perceived need to bring the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span> into government.